VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//RGBB SKYNET//Last War Calendar//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Last War - Server #2013 Events
X-WR-TIMEZONE:UTC
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rgbb-weekly-1@lastwar
DTSTART:20251215T180000
DURATION:PT2H
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:Radar Training (1VP ★)
DESCRIPTION:Arms Race: Drone Boost\nVS Duel: Radar Training\nVP: 1\n\nDO: Collect stacked radar missions (after 6:05 PM reset)\nDO: Spend all stamina on attacks/rallies/radar\nDO: Open drone data CHIP chests (skill chips for Chip Lab)\nDO: Use drone combat data + train drone parts\nDO: Gather resources from mines (gold tiles = most points, alliance territory +25%)\n\nSAVE: Hero XP/shards/medals → THURSDAY\nSAVE: Construction speedups → TUESDAY\nSAVE: Research speedups → WEDNESDAY\nSAVE: Training speedups → FRIDAY\nSAVE: Drone COMPONENT chests → WEDNESDAY
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rgbb-weekly-2@lastwar
DTSTART:20251216T180000
DURATION:PT2H
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:Base Expansion (1VP ★)
DESCRIPTION:Arms Race: City Building\nVS Duel: Base Expansion\nVP: 1\n\nDO: Open ALL building completion presents (gift boxes)\nDO: Use ALL construction speedups to finish upgrades\nDO: Dispatch UR (gold) trade trucks — refresh for Legendary!\nDO: Start Legendary secret tasks\nDO: Use survivor recruitment tickets\n\nSAVE: Research speedups → WEDNESDAY\nSAVE: Hero XP/shards/medals → THURSDAY\nSAVE: Training speedups → FRIDAY\nSAVE: Drone COMPONENT chests → WEDNESDAY
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rgbb-weekly-3@lastwar
DTSTART:20251217T180000
DURATION:PT2H
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=WE
SUMMARY:Age of Science (1VP ★)
DESCRIPTION:Arms Race: Tech Research\nVS Duel: Age of Science\nVP: 1\n\nDO: Use ALL research speedups to complete tech projects\nDO: Open drone COMPONENT chests (ONLY score today!)\nDO: Spend Valor Badges on Alliance Duel research\nDO: Collect stacked radar missions (after 6:05 PM)\nDO: Start new research → speedup → repeat for max completions\n\nSAVE: Hero XP/shards/medals → THURSDAY\nSAVE: Training speedups → FRIDAY
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rgbb-weekly-4@lastwar
DTSTART:20251218T180000
DURATION:PT2H
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TH
SUMMARY:Train Heroes (2VP ★★)
DESCRIPTION:Arms Race: Hero Advancement\nVS Duel: Train Heroes\nVP: 2\n\nDO: Dump ALL hero XP into priority heroes\nDO: Use ALL hero shards (star up heroes)\nDO: Apply ALL skill medals\nDO: Use hero weapon shards\nDO: Use recruitment tickets (Legendary/New Era/Hero Return)\nDO: Honorable Campaign resets today!\n\nSAVE: Training speedups → FRIDAY (tomorrow, the big day!)\nSAVE: Construction speedups → next TUESDAY
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rgbb-weekly-5@lastwar
DTSTART:20251219T180000
DURATION:PT2H
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR
SUMMARY:Total Mobilization (3VP ★★★)
DESCRIPTION:Arms Race: Unit Progression\nVS Duel: Total Mobilization\nVP: 3\n\nDO: WATERFALL: Train T5 → upgrade T6 → T7 → T8 (each tier = more points!)\nDO: Use ALL training speedups (4x point multiplier!)\nDO: Collect stacked radar missions (after 6:05 PM)\nDO: Use any leftover construction/research speedups\nDO: Train as many batches as possible — every troop counts!\n\nSAVE: Healing speedups → SATURDAY
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rgbb-weekly-6@lastwar
DTSTART:20251220T180000
DURATION:PT2H
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA
SUMMARY:Enemy Buster (4VP ★★★★)
DESCRIPTION:Arms Race: Enemy Buster\nVS Duel: Enemy Buster\nVP: 4\n\nDO: Buy 24hr shield (5,000 diamonds) AFTER attacking\nDO: Scout targets FIRST — find bases with troops defending\nDO: Attack enemy bases (coordinate with alliance for timing!)\nDO: Use healing speedups to revive and attack again\nDO: Remove YOUR defense lineup to minimize losses if attacked\nDO: Attack at ~4:05am server time if possible (opponents sleeping)\n\nSAVE: Start saving everything for next week's cycle!
END:VEVENT
